 71→// RegisterGate sets a concurrency limit for an agent's tests.
 72→// Tests call AcquireSlot/ReleaseSlot to respect this limit.
 73→// The limit can be overridden via E2E_CONCURRENT_TEST_LIMIT.
 74→func RegisterGate(name string, defaultMax int) {
